      ## Purpose
      Defines how the job reads the comments of a thread, so none is lost.
      
      ## ADDED Requirements
      
      ### Requirement: The job keeps every comment
      The job SHALL keep every comment of a thread.
      
      #### Scenario: The last comment
      - **WHEN** a thread has two comments
      - **THEN** both comments are kept
  
